// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Akiro_Musashi 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Sakai Tamaki 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3256819266" "Sakai Tamaki"
// ProfessionString :
"P4108092690" "The Tsoo's Inside Man"
// DescriptionString :
"P1393884106" "The Tsoo have their hands in most everything that goes on in Paragon City. Tub Ci, the leader of the Tsoo, even likes to control the prison population (as much as you can control a psychotic bunch of ex-super powered criminals). His inside man is Sakai Tamaki. Tamaki uses his ninja training to slip out of, and back into, the Ziggurat, giving Tub Ci the latest gossip and making sure that Tub Ci's orders are followed through on the inside. Tamaki's current orders from Tub Ci are to see that the people Arachnos has selected out of the Ziggurat alive."
// HelloString :
"P856364347" ""
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3026027868" "All you thugs look alike to me. If you need help, you should be talking to {LastContactName} back inside the prison."
// ZeroContactPointsString :
"P3901569558" "Lord Recluse, the most glorious leader of Arachnos, thinks that you may be a predestined soul. His Fortunata, Kalinda, has seen that you may well be one of those who can lead Arachnos to eventual victory over the heroes of Paragon City. We'll see about that. From what I hear, you still have a lot to learn, and even Kalinda isn't sure exactly who her prophecy pertains to. She just knows they're here in the Zig. I've been instructed to issue you a test of your combat abilities. If you pass, then you will be escorted to Mercy Island. Then Kalinda can test you for herself."
// NeverIssuedTaskString :
"P2020764107" "Click on <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>ask about available missions</A> to proceed."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3680740798" "You've passed Lord Recluse's test. The flyer is waiting for you, go see the {LastContactName} before he gets impatient and leaves."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3741295102" "FailsafeLevel"
// LocationString :
"P3988475886" "Breakout"
// IntroString :
"P3186707014" "Sakai Tamaki is a ninja, and the Tsoo's 'voice on the inside'. He stays in the Zig to make sure that the Tsoo have a say in what happens here as well. You should talk to Tamaki, as he can help you make your escape.<br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>Click here to accept Sakai Tamaki as a new contact</A>."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2281084950" "Click here to accept Sakai Tamaki as a Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3434836915" "<color deepskyblue>Tamaki can be found out in the Yard. Go through the hole blown in the floor in the offices here, and then a quick trip under the Zig's moat will bring you to some grated tubes. Just click on the grates to get out into the Yard. Tamaki will be waiting for you there.</color>"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P530831170" "I bet you want to start your new life now, so let's get you on the right path. You should seek out the  <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Arachnos Pilot</A>. He will spirit you away from here."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Angel_Lopez 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Angel Lopez 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1513168792" "Angel Lopez"
// ProfessionString :
"P892257207" "Connected Con"
// DescriptionString :
"P3282425649" "Angel's only been in the Zig for 2 months, but in that time he has made more connections than any current inmate. Most of the prison cliques can count Angel among their friends, so Angel is able to trade in favors better than even the hardest of the hard-core criminals. Some suspect Angel may have powers of his own, some sort of empathic charm or something, but no one has ever been able to find or prove anything."
// HelloString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P979515648" "You lost, ese? I think you should be chattin' with {LastContactName} before you chat with me, comprende?"
// ZeroContactPointsString :
"P1594422790" "So you call yourself {VillainName}, eh? That's cool. Well, I could hook you up with who ya need to get outta here, but with all the guards, heroes, and escaped prisoners runnin' around you are gonna need una poca fuerza, a little strength. I know a guy, deals in Superadine here in the Zig. If you want me to hook you up, just say so. You won't be sorry."
// NeverIssuedTaskString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3848839520" "You got your stuff, now go see {LastContactName}. <br><br><color deepskyblue>Tamaki can be found in the Yard. Go to the room with the big hole in the floor and jump into it, then follow the tunnel to the metal gates. Click on the gates and that will take you up into the Yard where you can find Sakai Tamaki.</color>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2198462574" "Angel Lopez is new to the Zig, but has taken to it like a duck to water. Angel has a lot of connections, and he can probably hook you up with just the right person to spring you.<br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>Click here to accept Angel Lopez as a new contact</A>"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P66505657" "Click here to accept Angel Lopez as a new Contact."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P43290859" "<color deepskyblue>An icon has been placed into your Compass pointing towards Angel's location. <br><img src=Tut_v_Contact_Nav.tga><br> If you put this symbol in the middle of your compass, Angel will be directly ahead of you. You may need to walk around walls or other obstacles to get to Angel.</color>"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2833673845" "Looks like you are all pumped up and ready to tackle the Yard at this point. When you get there you should chat to  <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Sakai Tamaki</A>. He asked about you while you were dealing with Mr. Verde. He made mention that Lord Recluse, the supreme leader of the villainous organization Arachnos, has been asking about you personally. Tamaki said Arachnos has been looking for some sort of special people, people with a destiny. I don't know who they're talking about, but maybe you can convince them you're special enough to get out of here. You'll have to be smart, though, and you'll have to be tough. Arachnos doesn't take chances on people who can't prove their worth."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Arachnos_Pilot 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Arachnos Pilot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2733609663" "Arachnos Pilot"
// ProfessionString :
"P4157298180" "Pilot for Arachnos"
// DescriptionString :
"P420953407" "Since most of Arachnos' operations result in ill-gotten gains, Lord Recluse pays his foot soldiers very well. At the top of this food chain are his pilots. Finding experienced pilots willing to take the risks needed for his operations is a difficult task for Lord Recluse, so he ensures their loyalty by giving them the highest pay, and the best perks, of any Arachnos soldiers."
// HelloString :
"P1755379771" "<img align=right src=Tut_Status.tga><br>I see you have enough experience points to reach Threat Level 2. Notice the arrow in your Status Circle. You need to visit an Arbiter to raise your threat level and receive a new power.<br><br>Arbiter Diaz can be found right off the landing pad on Mercy Island. Click on <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>ask about available missions</A> to learn about your contacts on Mercy Island.<br><br><color deepskyblue>If you click on Leave you will automatically be transported to Mercy Island, and must seek out Kalinda yourself.</color>"
// FirstVisitString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2181490660" "I'm here to take a select few out of here, and until I know you are one of those, you should be talking to {LastContactName}."
// ZeroContactPointsString :
"P2220782076" "Well, well, you've arrived. Pardon my skepticism, but if I had a dollar for every punk convict who thinks they're destined for greatness, I'd be running my own criminal organization. I guess we'll see what you're made of when Kalinda gets her hands on you. Anyway, are you ready to get out of here? There are just a few loose ends to tie up before we take off."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1441586598" "I think we should be going."
// NeverIssuedTaskString :
// PlayerBusyString :
"P202137506" "You need to finish your assigned tasks."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4166742859" "You've made it this far, so it's time to leave. Go to the Arachnos Pilot at the far end of the Yard. He has a Flyer waiting for your exit.<br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>Click here to accept Arachnos Pilot as a new contact</A>"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1819795161" "Click here to make the Arachnos Pilot your Contact."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1327520077" "<color deepskyblue>Make your way to the end of the Yard. The Arachnos Pilot and his Flyer are waiting for you there.</color>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : HT 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : H.T. (Click this contact to begin) 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3369385554" "H.T. (Click this contact to begin)"
// ProfessionString :
"P938774293" "Career Criminal"
// DescriptionString :
"P1270345966" "H.T. (short for Hard Time) is a mutant with powerful eye-based blasts. As part of his sentance he has restraining goggles permanently attached to his face.<br><br>H.T. knows he's guilty and has come to accept his fate. Although given many chances to escape in the past, H.T. has always declined, saying that there was a 'higher purpose' for him. H.T. claims to be plagued by chronic pain brought on from injuries received fighting against the Freedom Phalanx. H.T. knows a good thing when he sees it, and is always willing to help a guy out, in exchange for a few favors."
// FirstVisitString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P973700779" "IDontKnowYou"
// ZeroContactPointsString :
"P588579254" "I'm not sure what happened. There was some kinda big explosion that shook loose a bunch of the cells. Most of the cons made a break for it and ran out into the Yard, only to be recaptured by security. Lots of people are saying Arachnos is involved, that they're trying to break out some sort of special people. Could even be you, I guess. <br><br> If you want to make a break for it though, you are gonna have to play it smart. I can hook you up with the right people to talk to, but I need a favor in return...<br><br><color deepskyblue>HT is a Contact. Contacts issue missions and generally move the story forward. By clicking on 'Ask about available missions', you can see what missions HT has to offer. By completing HT's and other Contacts missions in the tutorial, you will learn about the controls and interface of City of Villains.</color>"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1162890521" "You should go see {LastContactName} now, {VillainName}. I told him to expect you."
// NeverIssuedTaskString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P69854740" "You should go see {LastContactName} now, {VillainName}. There's nothing more you can do for me."
// LocationString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P864494837" "IntroOneContact"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3231387856" "OK, I know you are dying to get outta here. Well,  <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>I got two guys you can see.</A> If you want to make a direct break for it, then you can go see Angel Lopez. But if you want to grab some of your equipment, then you should talk to Jimmy Dortz instead."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Jimmy_Dortz 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jimmy Dortz 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2295078232" "Jimmy Dortz"
// ProfessionString :
"P1450417894" "Model Inmate"
// DescriptionString :
"P1000505349" "Jimmy Dortz is what the Zig likes to call a 'model inmate'. He never disobeys any of the rules, and is always gaining the favor of the guards by making their jobs easier. What no one realizes is the Dortz is actually manipulating the whole scene. He rats out prisoners that he wants to see punished, and in doing so he earns favor with the guards, which he uses to get privileges that other inmates don't. For as much 'good behavior' that Dortz seems to gain, you really don't want to get on his bad side."
// HelloString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P851698854" "Hey, I don't know you. If you're new, you should probably be talking to {LastContactName} instead of me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1317581692" "I have something, but it's classified beyond your current Security Level."
// ZeroContactPointsString :
"P1902992733" "So you're the one called {VillainName}, eh? Well, all sorts of guys and gals locked up here have powers, but some need gadgets to make their powers work, or just to make them work better. I can give you access to the lockers that hold all these devices, and after you go there and get something for me, I can help show you how to use them."
// NeverIssuedTaskString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1989690787" "You got your devices, now go see {LastContactName}. <br><br><color deepskyblue>Tamaki can be found in the Yard. Go to the room with the big hole in the floor and jump into it, then follow the tunnel to the metal gates. Click on the gates and that will take you up into the Yard where you can find Sakai Tamaki.</color>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2522140344" "Jimmy Dortz is a guy that you can count on to get the things you need. He's got a good rep with the guards, so they let him in on all the secrets of the Zig, and if you have any tech devices that you need to use your powers, he's the guy to talk to.<br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>Click here to accept Jimmy Dortz as a new contact</A>"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P247018040" "Click here to accept Jimmy Dortz as a new Contact."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1875240541" "<color deepskyblue>An icon has been placed into your Compass pointing towards Jimmy's location.<br><img src=Tut_v_Contact_Nav.tga><br>If you put this symbol in the middle of your compass, Jimmy will be directly ahead of you. You may need to walk around walls or other obstacles to get to Jimmy.</color>"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P993664474" "Looks like you are fully armed and operational. Now you gotta go see <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Sakai Tamaki</A>. He was just in here asking about you specifically while you were off getting your stuff. He's broken outta here more times than Statesman has stars, so you'd best listen to what he has to say. He made mention that Lord Recluse, the supreme leader of the villainous organization Arachnos, has been asking about the you personally. Tamaki said Arachnos was looking for some sort of 'special people,' whatever that means. Could be you're one of them. 'Course, I wouldn't count on that to write your ticket with Arachnos. They'll expect you to take care of business on your own."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

